```
an empty string             generator => ACCEPTED   handler => InvalidArgumentException
an empty string in a list   generator => ACCEPTED   handler => InvalidArgumentException
a non-string in a list      generator => ACCEPTED   handler => InvalidArgumentException
generator with ''   mints  aud=""
generator with [42] mints  aud="42"
```

